{"id": "53222", "title": "囚你", "author": "草草鸟事", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 32, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/53/53222.htm", "intro": "１－２４章，作者只到这里了。\r\n失去你是最决绝的痛她走了，她宁愿带着女儿被烈火吞噬，也不愿意再留在他身边，甚至连只言片语也不屑留给他。他知道自己卑鄙的利用了她的感情，也知道自己伤她有多深，不是没有想过她会自杀的可能，可是当这一刻真的来临，他才明白失去她是自己不能承受的痛！", "base": "files/article/html/53/53222", "chapters": [{"title": "失去你是最决绝的痛", "file": "7478831.html", "available": false}, {"title": "２　拿什么惩罚你，我的贱男", "file": "7478832.html", "available": false}, {"title": "３梦中诀别", "file": "7478836.html", "available": false}, {"title": "４　父「爱」难为", "file": "7478838.html", "available": false}, {"title": "５　父女ＪＱ的幼芽", "file": "7478842.html", "available": false}, {"title": "６　转身投入你怀里", "file": "7478844.html", "available": false}, {"title": "７　夜半无人私语时", "file": "7478845.html", "available": false}, {"title": "８父皇，我愿意给你", "file": "7478847.html", "available": false}, {"title": "９　彻底占有你", "file": "7478849.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１０春水荡", "file": "7478851.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１１靡雾起", "file": "7478853.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１２　春夜无涯", "file": "7478855.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１３嘤咛声声蜜意浓", "file": "7478857.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１４当利用变成悔恨", "file": "7478858.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１５　痛「掣」心扉", "file": "7478860.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１６无言的悲怆", "file": "7478863.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１７　回首惘然", "file": "7478864.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１８　为伊白发", "file": "7478866.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１９　披着羊皮的狼哥哥", "file": "7478869.html", "available": false}, {"title": "２０　与狼共舞", "file": "7478870.html", "available": false}, {"title": "２１　亲手杀了爱情", "file": "7478872.html", "available": false}, {"title": "２２　父子对峙", "file": "7478874.html", "available": false}, {"title": "２３　父皇妒火难平", "file": "7478876.html", "available": false}, {"title": "２４　父皇很生气后果很严重", "file": "7478878.html", "available": false}, {"title":